

-> What is Stack Memory?
    Stores method calls
    Thread-specific (each thread has its own stack)
    Faster than heap
    No garbage collection



-> What is a Stack Frame?

   Each method call creates a stack frame containing:
       Local variables
       Method parameters
       Return address
       Operand stack



-> Stack vs Heap

| Feature | Stack           | Heap    |
| ------- | --------------- | ------- |
| Thread  | Private         | Shared  |
| Stores  | Local variables | Objects |
| Speed   | Fast            | Slower  |
| GC      | No              | Yes     |
| Size    | Small           | Large   |
